<title>HONG KONG: Merrill Lynch sets warrants on COSCO.</title>
<headline>Merrill Lynch sets warrants on COSCO.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-09-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Merrill Lynch International &amp; Co C.V. said it has launched 554 million American-style call warrants on shares of COSCO Pacific Ltd.</p>
<p>Ten warrants control one share.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE	HK$5.52	PREMIUM	 8.7 PCT</p>
<p> ISSUE PRICE	 HK$0.198     GEARING	 3.48X</p>
<p> EXPIRATION	  19.SEP.97    PAYDATE	 3 WKS AFTER LAUNCH</p>
<p> LISTING	     HONG KONG    MIN EXER LOT  20,000</p>
<p> SPOT REFERENCE    HK$6.90</p>
<p> NOTES		 GOVERNING LAW IS HONG KONG</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6370</p>
</text>
